<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xml:lang="en-US">
  <voice name="en-US-AvaNeural">
    <prosody rate="-12%">
      Your relationship has a thousand little moments.
      <break time="1500ms" />
      The conversations you had.
      <break time="1000ms" />
      The things you never want to forget.
      <break time="1000ms" />
      The games you played just to make each other laugh.
      <break time="1800ms" />
      Pairfect brings them all into one private space — just for the two of you.
      <break time="1600ms" />
      Ask something deeper.
      <break time="1200ms" />
      Leave them a letter.
      <break time="1200ms" />
      Challenge each other.
      <break time="1200ms" />
      Keep the moments that became your story.
      <break time="2000ms" />
      Because your relationship isn't just something you live.
      <break time="1500ms" />
      It's something worth keeping.
      <break time="2200ms" />
      Pairfect.
      <break time="800ms" />
      Conversations that connect.
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
